## SQ-DEP-01 | coaster offset mixin (now in creativedelight.mixins.json, gated on Brewin'): no apply error or skip
@group A
@commands Boot (full pack): `grep -iE "blockheads_additions.mixins.json\|CoasterRendererOffset\|\[blockheads_additions\]" logs/latest.log`
@pass no apply error or skip line for the coaster mixin (Brewin' is loaded)
@fails plugin class name in the json, shared_base package
@from batches/r1113/c2_a1.qb
shell grep -niE "CoasterRendererOffset|blockheads_additions|creativedelight.mixins.json.*(error|fail|skip)" logs/latest.log logs/debug.log | head -6 | cut -c1-240; true
bootreject creativedelight\.mixins\.json.*(rror|ailed)
look no apply error or skip line; Blockheads Additions is a CD compartment since M8 (no blockheads_additions.mixins.json any more), and the coaster mixin is client-side, so on a server only the absence of errors is checked

