## SQ-DEP-09a | full pack: every creativedelight:mods pack enabled; corn maze loot; pancake, jam jar, clover drops; no ERR line
@group A
@commands Full pack boot: `/datapack list enabled`; `/loot spawn ~ ~ ~ loot hearthandharvest:chests/corn_maze` x10 and `hearthandharvest:chests/corn_maze_center` x10; `/loot spawn ~ ~ ~ loot rusticdelight:blocks/pancakes` is block loot, so instead `/setblock ~1 ~ ~ rusticdelight:pancakes[servings=2]` and break it with a bot; `/setblock ~2 ~ ~ vintagedelight:fd_lemon_jam_jar[jars=3]` and break it; `/setblock ~3 ~ ~ hearthandharvest:four_leaf_clover` and break it; `grep -nE "$ERR" logs/latest.log \| grep -iE "creativedelight\|hearthandharvest\|vintagedelight\|rusticdelight\|storagedelight\|creativeengineering:sawmill\|lingerification"`
@pass the enabled list has `creativedelight:mods/<m>` for brewinandchewin, buzzier_bees, corn_delight, create_factory, fruitsdelight, hostiledelight, moredelight, supplementaries, upgrade_aquatic, vinery; corn maze chests give Corn Delight items, cider or caramel apples among the 20 rolls; the pancake plate (`servings=2`) drops 4 `supplementaries:pancake` and a bowl (servings counts eaten slices in Rustic's numbering; the table gives 6 - servings); the jar drops 3 `fruitsdelight:lemon_jelly`; the clover drops `buzzier_bees:four_leaf_clover`; no grep hit
@fails a missing pack: `CompartmentPacks.addModData` folder name vs mod id, `pack.mcmeta`; no item from a sub-table: `<ns>:mod_items/<mod>/<item>` path in `packs/mods/<mod>/data/<ns>/loot_tables/mod_items/`
@reviewed 2026-11-16
@from batches/r1115/p7_a0.qb
